MedVista Hospital Analytics System
Backend: Node.js
Database: MongoDB
Frontend: HTML, CSS, JavaScript
Run: START_HOSPITAL_SYSTEM.bat
URL: http://127.0.0.1:5000

Python support:
- Optional Python analytics service: python/analytics.py
- Python reads data through the Node.js API.
- MongoDB remains the only persistent database.
- No SQL or SQLite database is included.
